          "text": "Originator: YES",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "sorry, but it was rather a problem on my side: my fedora runs on port 8082 and in this bmech.xml port 8080 is hardcoded (what does on do to port those definitiosn to another server?).",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "ps: is it possible to fix the mailing mechanism to use the real email-address as To: instead of noreply@sourceforge.net?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
