     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The problem, as noted, is that the tutorial 2 objects expect the server to be running on port 8080. This is reasonable for a tutorial. Regardless, tutorial 2 has been reworked for Fedora 3.0 and this issue is no longer relevant.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
