     "content": [
      {
       "text": "hi,",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "i tried to follow the tutorial 2 example 3 to use bDef/bMech and datastreams.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ingesting both bDef and bMech went well (no visible errors at least), even creating the object.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "but after that i tried to access the \"disseminated\" object by browsing",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8082/fedora/get/demo:300/demo:ex3bDef/getContent/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8082/fedora/get/demo:300/demo:ex3bDef/getContent/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "which means going to ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8082/fedora/get/demo:300"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8082/fedora/get/demo:300",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "clicking ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"View the Dissemination Index for this Object\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "and then in the table of disseminators \"Run\" for",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "demo:ex3bDef  | getContent",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "all i got was a blank page and a lengthy stacktrace in catalina.out:",
